{"updated":"2026-11-27T00:25+00:00","warnings":[{"event":"Yellow ice warning","level":"yellow","headline":"There is small chance of freezing rain leading to icy surfaces, and significant impacts to travel on higher routes of the Pennines","description":"A band of rain is expected to move slowly east, and could fall as freezing rain for a time down to around 300m. Should this occur, it could lead to widespread icy surfaces, with a particular risk for roads and pathways that rise to higher elevations over the Pennines. The rain could also briefly turn to snow before easing and clearing on Friday afternoon, with temporary accumulations of 1-3cm.","impacts":["A small chance that stretches of roads, pavements and cycle paths become impassable","There is a slight chance that bus and train services may be delayed or cancelled, with some road closures and longer journey times","A small chance of injuries from slips and falls on icy surfaces"],"onset":"2026-11-27T04:00:00+00:00","expires":"2026-11-27T14:00:00+00:00","areas":[{"name":"East Midlands | North East England | North West England | West Midlands | Yorkshire & Humber","polygons":[[[54.928,-2.326],[54.93,-2.341],[54.931,-2.357],[54.933,-2.373],[54.934,-2.391],[54.935,-2.408],[54.936,-2.425],[54.937,-2.443],[54.937,-2.461],[54.937,-2.478],[54.937,-2.494],[54.936,-2.511],[54.935,-2.526],[54.933,-2.541],[54.931,-2.555],[54.928,-2.565],[54.926,-2.576],[54.923,-2.587],[54.92,-2.598],[54.917,-2.608],[54.914,-2.618],[54.91,-2.628],[54.906,-2.637],[54.902,-2.645],[54.897,-2.653],[54.892,-2.66],[54.887,-2.666],[54.882,-2.671],[54.876,-2.675],[54.865,-2.679],[54.854,-2.68],[54.841,-2.679],[54.827,-2.675],[54.813,-2.669],[54.797,-2.661],[54.781,-2.652],[54.765,-2.643],[54.748,-2.632],[54.731,-2.621],[54.714,-2.61],[54.697,-2.599],[54.681,-2.589],[54.664,-2.58],[54.645,-2.569],[54.626,-2.557],[54.607,-2.545],[54.587,-2.533],[54.567,-2.519],[54.547,-2.506],[54.527,-2.492],[54.507,-2.478],[54.486,-2.464],[54.465,-2.451],[54.444,-2.